# Zmienne: .vscode/settings.json → rest-client.environmentVariables.$shared
# Wymaga sesji — uruchom Signin z auth.http (domyślna rola: ADMIN)

### Odczyt firmy
GET {{baseUrl}}/company

### Aktualizacja firmy (ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/company
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "name": "Moja Firma",
  "email": "firma@example.com",
  "phone": "123456789",
  "taxId": "123-456-78-90",
  "address": "ul. Firmowa 10",
  "postalCode": "00-001",
  "city": "Warszawa"
}
